      "https://developer.nylas.com/_spec-files/nylas-api.yaml (components.schemas message, thread, draft, attachment, folder, contact)",
      "https://developer.nylas.com/docs/reference/notifications/ (event, calendar, notetaker, booking, grant object schemas)"
    ],
    "generated": "2026-09-28",
    "note": "Field names are Nylas API field names verbatim. `object` is the Nylas resource discriminator and is aliased to @type; its values (message, event, ...) are the class terms. Nylas timestamps are Unix epoch seconds, so they are typed nylas:UnixTimestamp and deliberately NOT mapped to schema.org Date/DateTime properties. schema.org is used only where the semantics match; everything else stays in the Nylas glossary namespace."
  }
}
